+// Standalone-library extension: directly synthesize N output frames. Bypasses
+// the tick-event scheduler so callers that don't run a real CPU clock can
+// still get audio out. Each frame = 1 sample at SAMPLE_RATE (44100Hz stereo).
+// Calls SPU::Execute internally with the equivalent CPU-tick count, so all
+// downstream bookkeeping (ADSR, reverb, capture buffer, key-on/key-off)
+// runs exactly as during normal emulation.
+void GenerateSamples(u32 num_frames);
